Appendix: Key Excel Formulas & Shortcuts 
Common formulas used in this project: 
Trim + Clean + Substitute (remove non-breaking spaces): 
=TRIM(CLEAN(SUBSTITUTE(A2,CHAR(160),""))) 
Median (ignore blanks): =MEDIAN(Q2:Q1501) 
COUNTBLANK: =COUNTBLANK(range) 
IQR bounds: Q1 = QUARTILE.INC(range,1); Q3 = QUARTILE.INC(range,3); IQR = Q3-Q1 
Impute with median (using blanks selection): Select blanks → type =$AE$1 → Ctrl+Enter 
→ Paste Special → Values 
Profit margin: =IF(Sales=0,NA(), Profit/Sales) 
Useful shortcuts: Ctrl+G → Special → Blanks; Ctrl+Enter ( ill selected blanks); Alt+H+V+S 
(Paste Special). 
 
